{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-10-17 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"Bob林盛斌18歲女兒展現大碼曲線美  低胸衫谷出豐滿上圍滿臉自信  網民洗版式留言\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63b39ee2625bde6914d6ca654f4bb323/2026-10/Copy_of_Copy_of_KF_108.png\"/>\n<p>金牌司儀林盛斌（Bob）的18歲大女兒林霏兒（Faye）一向敢作敢為，其大膽作風與自信舉動不時成為網民熱話。林霏兒近日在社交平台分享多張生活靚相，她身穿桃紅色低胸上衣，盡顯豐滿上圍，雖然她屬於「大碼身材」，卻仍舊自信爆棚，對鏡頭擺出性感姿勢，另一張街頭夜景照中，她則以白色低胸小背心搭配淺黃色外套，舉出「V」字手勢，展現活潑一面。</p>\n<h2>林盛斌女兒陽光真性情狂圈粉</h2>\n<p>林霏兒敢於展現真實自我的坦率態度，獲得網民紛紛激讚，網民大讚她五官漂亮兼性格討喜，「頭一幅影得好靚」、「beautiful girl」及「you are the cutesttt!!」，更有網民深受其自信魅力感動，熱情為她打氣：「我好鍾意妳個人性格，唔需要理會別人，做自己喜歡的事。只要不是壞事！」力撐她打破外貌與身形焦慮。早前林霏兒成功接下內衣KOL推廣工作，憑藉陽光率真形象，成功令網民改觀，一面倒給她正評。</p>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌與太太黃乙頤（Pearl）結婚近20年。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/189db8694093364aee0f9a6f0b02bf43/2023-10/BOB_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌與老婆黃乙頤育有三女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9c8a14d6162b24d5101825369f7fd525/2023-10/BOB_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌女兒林霏兒近日在社交平台分享靚相，身穿桃紅色低胸上衣，大方展現豐滿身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6d09f9b98d060fd49455587b621f559/2026-10/SaveClip_App_850032172_18222034705347261_568600171195011953_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒以低胸小背心，擺出「V」字手勢自拍，流露活潑少女感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93f7a51489b4e7e714f19c1f2ca16202/2026-10/SaveClip_App_849772981_18222035017347261_217897742559872612_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒早前騷出演藝學院的學生證，原來她已是演藝學院的學生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6e9e8045090e8aee084147db41e58db1/2026-08/a_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒早前於社交平台Instagram上載一段展示身材的短片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f57df2bd03a05a57acc98088b755244b/2026-08/1_6_28.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒換上四套不同顏色的低胸貼身運動套裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa1d5ef9217e127a78e907a1a227d775/2026-08/2_6_30.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒大方展示豐滿身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/93e08d159fbab2142cf1026876995880/2026-08/3_5_28.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒懶理網民之前對她行為舉止與身材的評價。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c2a3a778729ea8b69f97da664bc744b/2026-08/4_5_27.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒在鏡頭前擺出多個自信姿勢，散發青春活力，再次引起網民討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/681f9bf262b3457f03282afc4ab59383/2026-08/5_6_21.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒（中）早前跟閨密睇演唱會，大騷T-BACK展現自信性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cdc96138bb53f5998df3fbb556db584d/2026-05/r3_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒和妹妹，早前以這身造型出席首映禮後被網暴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79f244467a64242b00e6d746535efebb/2026-05/R2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒拍片大反擊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dad8570e2b43caffc2c3e54a4954699d/2026-05/R4_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒指女孩就如一粒鑽石，不會因為批評而樣衰：「佢哋仲係一樣咁靚」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c085aa7b66a3e8fcace8c6ddcca240aa/2026-05/R6_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bob林盛斌大女林霏兒18歲生日，超性感慶生展自信一面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee2e66932362feb7d12a4e5c2aad8e2b/2026-06/1_8_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒的生日會極有氣氛，尤如迷幻派對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1eefc5308a7ed0947bf0a61fd88875e/2026-06/b_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒開心得緊擁閨密。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8bfcc269ff83ff3dc62ee5244d16c30f/2026-06/d_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒和年輕男士合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/969d105dd18af7b2be9ef27cb5776672/2026-06/e_0_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒18歲生日，IG晒昔日全家福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c03f28469b6bbddbd71549bb11a561b6/2026-06/2_2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bob林盛斌大女林霏兒18歲生日，同朋友玩到癲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51db9eab4e41512fa5a987c10e7679cb/2026-06/3_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bob林盛斌大女林霏兒18歲生日，點少得生日蛋糕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc25f32e352390c53efa017b65d86a03/2026-06/4_5_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Bob林盛斌太太黃乙頤，於IG晒相賀大女林霏兒18歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54d7147ce708735b407c7c33e5354d9c/2026-06/5_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<h2>林霏兒棄海外獎學金留港攻讀戲劇</h2>\n<p>林霏兒不僅積極經營社交平台，富有強烈表演慾的她，亦早已為未來演藝事業鋪路。林霏兒早前透露已獲香港演藝學院戲劇學院的基礎文憑課程取錄，目標是在完成一年課程後順利銜接學士學位。其父Bob林盛斌日前受訪時自豪透露，女兒一直夢想演出英語音樂劇，早前其實已考獲外國知名學府的獎學金，惟最終選擇留港打好基礎。對於女兒將來是否繼承衣缽正式出道做藝人，Bob則全力護航，表示無論女兒將來打算留在演藝圈發展，抑或是畢業後想再赴海外深造，自己都會無條件在身後全力支持。</p>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌的大女霏霏長得亭亭玉立。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89e6546ddcbc0f7d5a0dbfd233145c4f/2024-05/FAYE_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌大女林霏兒下廚，曝光家中廚房，見到有雜物房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c8e9f81af1be7170467adfe1f610e6e2/2026-02/BOB_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌的廚房擺幾箱水果都大把地方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cfbb766e31ee04d505fec4bcb1e59e3e/2026-02/BOB_11_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌17歲大女林霏兒與弟弟分工合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1562e6678fffec8a06febcba49c797c1/2026-02/BOB_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌17歲大女林霏兒不慎晒身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9b4a51579f5fc17a4c1df7a3b9cb203/2026-02/BOB_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林霏兒下廚，見到廚房大到可以擺幾張麻雀枱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0b8d81b721bb4d16a055029504d2e68/2026-02/BOB_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌曾曝光家居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ae28253e21400040ad514409b960475/2024-05/FAYE_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌豪宅越搬越貴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/52903421fc60192b08ef2d49d706354f/2024-03/VS--BobLamboblamshingbunInstagram-0_16__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌一家六口更住在九龍塘四層獨立屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/83060f82ad8fb2cbfbf9ac9857c9cf60/2023-02/pearlwong_287230949_1228330457915219_6230929435981301359_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌屋企好大，廚房都好闊落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e925250c4adac2d3a372094936e08025/2023-03/bob_lamshingbun_318025708_118517204416181_3536684814930557624_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林盛斌太太的工作室空間感好充足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17b44543757728f0165b99a959b543dc/2023-03/bob_lamshingbun_293938341_3244361982474688_748422384533078878_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳可作小朋友的活動空間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71f4d613eb73e38e0de191db689ab27a/2023-02/VideoScreenshot--pearlwongInstagramphotosandvideos-0%E2%80%9935%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"睡房大過不少人的客廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2aadddc468009068c7e13e7c38fb637/2023-02/VideoScreenshot--BobLamboblamshingbunInstagramphotosandvideos-0%E2%80%9908%E2%80%9D%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T11:58:58.210253+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":653,"images":36,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T08:00:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T15:17:53.406867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T11:57:44.627216+00:00","content_hash":"bbaa744c22006527c424fe18a3048c406866108c99ef33fb02152285234f3a64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}